---
/**
 * 5 çekirdek AgyProp modülü — sade, nötr antrasit Bento Grid.
 */
---

<section id="ozellikler" class="py-24 sm:py-28 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500">
        Özellikler
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.025em] text-white">
        Günlük apartman yönetimi için gereken temel modüller.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Tahsilattan makbuza, sakin dekont onayından arıza takibi ve belge arşivine kadar tüm işlemler tek kayıtta tutulur.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5">
      <!-- 1. Aidat & FIFO Tahsilat -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-7 surface-card surface-card-hover specular-top rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#15171a] text-zinc-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3 3 7.5 12 12l9-4.5L12 3ZM3 12l9 4.5 9-4.5M3 16.5 12 21l9-4.5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Aidat &amp; Otomatik FIFO Tahsilat</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 max-w-xl">
            Gelen ödeme tek seferde girilir; sistem <span class="text-zinc-200 font-medium">FIFO</span> kuralıyla en eski açık dönemden başlayarak borçları sırayla kapatır, kısmi ödemeleri ve kalan bakiyeyi otomatik hesaplar.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#0d0f11] p-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-zinc-400">Ödeme · <span class="mono-num text-zinc-200">D-12</span></span>
            <span class="mono-num font-semibold text-white">₺3.500,00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#15171a] px-3 py-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
                <span class="text-zinc-400">Eylül 2026</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-500 font-medium">Kapandı</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-zinc-100 mono-num">₺1.500 / ₺1.500</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#15171a] px-3 py-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
                <span class="text-zinc-400">Ekim 2026</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-500 font-medium">Kapandı</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-zinc-100 mono-num">₺1.500 / ₺1.500</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-md border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#15171a] px-3 py-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
                <span class="text-zinc-400">Kasım 2026</span>
                <span class="text-zinc-400">Kısmi</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-zinc-100 mono-num">₺500 / ₺1.500</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 2. Tek Tıkla A5 PDF Makbuz & KVKK Pano İcmali -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-5 surface-card surface-card-hover specular-top rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#15171a] text-zinc-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 3h7l5 5v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-white">A5 PDF Makbuz &amp; KVKK Pano İcmali</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Tahsilat sonrası yazıcıya hazır A5 PDF makbuz oluşturun. İlan panosuna asacağınız borç/alacak icmallerini sakin adları maskelenmiş biçimde indirin.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#0d0f11] p-4 space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.07] pb-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400">
            <span class="font-medium text-zinc-200">Pano İcmali</span>
            <span class="mono-num text-zinc-500">A5 PDF</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-zinc-300">
            <span><span class="mono-num text-zinc-500 mr-1.5">D-01</span>H*** Ö****</span>
            <span class="mono-num text-zinc-400">₺0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-zinc-300">
            <span><span class="mono-num text-zinc-500 mr-1.5">D-02</span>K*** A*****</span>
            <span class="mono-num text-zinc-100">₺1.575</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-zinc-300">
            <span><span class="mono-num text-zinc-500 mr-1.5">D-03</span>E*** Ç****</span>
            <span class="mono-num text-zinc-400">₺0</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 3. Sakin Dekont & E-posta Otomasyonu -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-4 surface-card surface-card-hover specular-top rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#15171a] text-zinc-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4 7 8 6 8-6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-white">Sakin Dekont &amp; E-posta Otomasyonu</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Sakinler havale dekontlarını sisteme yükler. Onayladığınızda tahsilat otomatik işlenir ve makbuz e-posta ile iletilir.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-500">
          Dekont yükleme &rarr; Yönetici onayı &rarr; E-posta bildirimi
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- 4. Çoklu Bina & Denetim Kayıtları -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-4 surface-card surface-card-hover specular-top rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#15171a] text-zinc-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 21h18M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14M9 11h2M13 11h2M9 15h2M13 15h2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-white">Çoklu Bina &amp; Denetim Kayıtları</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Birden fazla apartman ve siteyi tek hesaptan izole kasalarla yönetin. Tüm tahsilat ve düzenlemeler zaman damgalı denetim günlüğünde tutulur.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#0d0f11] px-3 py-2 mono-num text-[11px] text-zinc-400">
          14:22 · Tahsilat onaylandı · B/D-09
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 5. Arıza/Bakım & Belge Arşivi -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-4 surface-card surface-card-hover specular-top rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#15171a] text-zinc-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L4 17l3 3 5.3-5.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.2 2.2-3-3 2.2-2.2Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-white">Arıza/Bakım &amp; R2 Belge Arşivi</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Asansör bakımı ve ortak alan taleplerini durum bazlı izleyin. Fatura, sözleşme ve karar defterlerini Cloudflare R2 arşivinde saklayın.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-6 mono-num text-[11px] text-zinc-500">
          Asansör_Bakım.pdf · Karar_2026.pdf
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
